{"seq":1,"slug":"component-patterns","title":"React Native 组件模式与复用策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/core-development/component-patterns","wordCount":1078,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-native-组件模式与复用策略\">React Native 组件模式与复用策略</h1><p>一个 React Native 应用的代码质量，很大程度上取决于组件如何被设计和组织。与 Web 端 React 相比，移动端组件设计需要额外考虑平台交互习惯（触摸区域、手势优先级）、原生控件的渲染性能，以及不同屏幕尺寸的布局适配。本文覆盖在 React Native 生态中经过实践验证的组件模式，以及通过自定义 Hooks 实现逻辑复用的策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>受控组件与非受控组件</strong>：受控组件的状态由 React 管理（通过 <code>value</code> 和 <code>onChangeText</code>），非受控组件使用 <code>defaultValue</code> 并由原生管理状态；在 React Native 中文本输入应优先使用受控模式。</li>\n<li><strong>复合组件（Compound Components）</strong>：通过 Context 共享状态的一组组件，暴露统一的外部 API 同时保持内部实现灵活——例如 <code>&lt;Tabs&gt;</code> + <code>&lt;Tabs.Tab&gt;</code> 的组合。</li>\n<li><strong>Render Props</strong>：通过 <code>render</code> 或 <code>children</code> 作为函数传递渲染逻辑，实现行为与 UI 的分离；在 Hooks 普及后使用频率降低，但在部分场景仍有价值。</li>\n<li><strong>自定义 Hooks（Custom Hooks）</strong>：将有状态逻辑（数据获取、设备传感器订阅、手势状态管理）从组件中提取出来，实现跨组件复用而不引入额外的组件层级。</li>\n<li><strong>StyleSheet.create</strong>：React Native 的样式表工厂，提前序列化样式对象并在原生层缓存，避免每次渲染时重新序列化样式；是性能敏感场景下优于内联样式的写法。</li>\n<li><strong>FlashList</strong>：Shopify 开源的高性能列表组件，通过复用原生视图（而非仅复用 JS 组件）实现比 <code>FlatList</code> 更高的滚动性能，推荐替代方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"组件结构-容器与展示的分离\">组件结构：容器与展示的分离</h2><p>在 React Native 中，将数据获取/业务逻辑（容器层）和 UI 渲染（展示层）分离，是提高组件可测试性和复用性的基础模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 展示层：纯 UI，通过 props 接收数据&#10;interface UserCardProps {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  avatar: string;&#10;  bio: string;&#10;  onPress: () =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function UserCard({ name, avatar, bio, onPress }: UserCardProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;TouchableOpacity onPress={onPress} activeOpacity={0.8}&gt;&#10;      &lt;Image source={{ uri: avatar }} style={styles.avatar} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Text style={styles.name}&gt;{name}&lt;/Text&gt;&#10;      &lt;Text style={styles.bio} numberOfLines={2}&gt;{bio}&lt;/Text&gt;&#10;    &lt;/TouchableOpacity&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;const styles = StyleSheet.create({&#10;  avatar: { width: 48, height: 48, borderRadius: 24 },&#10;  name: { fontSize: 16, fontWeight: &#39;600&#39; },&#10;  bio: { fontSize: 14, color: &#39;#666&#39; },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 容器层：处理数据获取，传递给展示组件&#10;function UserCardContainer({ userId }: { userId: string }) {&#10;  const { data: user, isLoading } = useUser(userId);&#10;&#10;  if (isLoading) return &lt;UserCardSkeleton /&gt;;&#10;  if (!user) return null;&#10;&#10;  const handlePress = () =&gt; navigation.navigate(&#39;UserProfile&#39;, { userId });&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;UserCard&#10;      name={user.name}&#10;      avatar={user.avatarUrl}&#10;      bio={user.bio}&#10;      onPress={handlePress}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 展示层：纯 UI，通过 props 接收数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserCardProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avatar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onPress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserCard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">avatar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">onPress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserCardProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TouchableOpacity onPress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{onPress} activeOpacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Image source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uri</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: avatar }} style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{styles.avatar} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Text style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{styles.name}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{name}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Text style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{styles.bio} numberOfLines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{bio}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TouchableOpacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> styles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StyleSheet.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  avatar: { width: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, height: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, borderRadius: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: { fontSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fontWeight: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'600'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bio: { fontSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, color: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#666'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 容器层：处理数据获取，传递给展示组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserCardContainer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isLoading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isLoading) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UserCardSkeleton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handlePress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">navigate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UserProfile'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { userId });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">UserCard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{user.name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      avatar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{user.avatarUrl}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      bio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{user.bio}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onPress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handlePress}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种分离使展示组件可以在 Storybook 中独立渲染和测试，无需 mock 数据层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"列表渲染-高性能策略\">列表渲染：高性能策略</h2><p>列表是移动应用中最常见的 UI 模式，也是性能问题最集中的地方。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ListChoice{列表数据量}&#10;    Small[&lt;50条 → ScrollView]&#10;    Medium[50-500条 → FlatList]&#10;    Large[&gt;500条或复杂行 → FlashList]&#10;    Infinite[无限滚动 → FlashList + useInfiniteQuery]&#10;&#10;    ListChoice --&gt; Small&#10;    ListChoice --&gt; Medium&#10;    ListChoice --&gt; Large&#10;    ListChoice --&gt; Infinite\">graph TD\n    ListChoice{列表数据量}\n    Small[&lt;50条 → ScrollView]\n    Medium[50-500条 → FlatList]\n    Large[&gt;500条或复杂行 → FlashList]\n    Infinite[无限滚动 → FlashList + useInfiniteQuery]\n\n    ListChoice --&gt; Small\n    ListChoice --&gt; Medium\n    ListChoice --&gt; Large\n    ListChoice --&gt; Infinite</pre><p><strong>FlatList 的关键优化参数</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"&lt;FlatList&#10;  data={items}&#10;  renderItem={renderItem}&#10;  keyExtractor={(item) =&gt; item.id}&#10;  // 性能关键参数&#10;  getItemLayout={(_, index) =&gt; ({&#10;    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,&#10;    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,&#10;    index,&#10;  })}&#10;  initialNumToRender={10}&#10;  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}&#10;  windowSize={5}&#10;  removeClippedSubviews={true}&#10;  // 避免匿名函数——每次渲染会创建新引用，触发列表项重渲染&#10;/&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FlatList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{items}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  renderItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{renderItem}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  keyExtractor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{(item) => item.id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 性能关键参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  getItemLayout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{(_, index) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ITEM_HEIGHT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    offset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ITEM_HEIGHT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    index,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  })}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initialNumToRender</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxToRenderPerBatch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  windowSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  removeClippedSubviews</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{true}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 避免匿名函数——每次渲染会创建新引用，触发列表项重渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>FlashList 替代方案</strong>（推荐用于大列表）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { FlashList } from &#39;@shopify/flash-list&#39;;&#10;&#10;&lt;FlashList&#10;  data={items}&#10;  renderItem={renderItem}&#10;  estimatedItemSize={80}  // 必填：提供估计高度以优化布局计算&#10;  keyExtractor={(item) =&gt; item.id}&#10;/&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { FlashList } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@shopify/flash-list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FlashList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{items}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  renderItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{renderItem}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  estimatedItemSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必填：提供估计高度以优化布局计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  keyExtractor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{(item) => item.id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span></code></pre></div><p>FlashList 的性能优势来自<strong>回收原生视图</strong>（而非仅回收 React 组件），在滚动时减少原生视图的创建和销毁，在 Android 上尤为明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自定义-hooks-逻辑复用的首选方式\">自定义 Hooks：逻辑复用的首选方式</h2><p>自定义 Hooks 是 React Native 中提取有状态逻辑的标准方式，优于 HOC（高阶组件）和 Render Props，因为它们不引入额外的组件层级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 封装设备方向监听&#10;function useOrientation() {&#10;  const [orientation, setOrientation] = useState&lt;&#39;portrait&#39; | &#39;landscape&#39;&gt;(&#10;    () =&gt; Dimensions.get(&#39;window&#39;).width &lt; Dimensions.get(&#39;window&#39;).height&#10;      ? &#39;portrait&#39;&#10;      : &#39;landscape&#39;&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const subscription = Dimensions.addEventListener(&#39;change&#39;, ({ window }) =&gt; {&#10;      setOrientation(window.width &lt; window.height ? &#39;portrait&#39; : &#39;landscape&#39;);&#10;    });&#10;    return () =&gt; subscription.remove();&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return orientation;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 封装防抖搜索&#10;function useDebounce&lt;T&gt;(value: T, delay: number): T {&#10;  const [debouncedValue, setDebouncedValue] = useState&lt;T&gt;(value);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const timer = setTimeout(() =&gt; setDebouncedValue(value), delay);&#10;    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(timer);&#10;  }, [value, delay]);&#10;&#10;  return debouncedValue;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 在组件中使用&#10;function SearchScreen() {&#10;  const orientation = useOrientation();&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const debouncedQuery = useDebounce(query, 300);&#10;&#10;  // debouncedQuery 变化时才触发搜索请求&#10;  const { data } = useSearchResults(debouncedQuery);&#10;&#10;  return (/* ... */);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 封装设备方向监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useOrientation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orientation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setOrientation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'portrait'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'landscape'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Dimensions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'window'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Dimensions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'window'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).height</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'portrait'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'landscape'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> subscription</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Dimensions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">window</span